<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ ADRs mixed in late N.Y. while Dow edges up.</title>
<headline>NZ ADRs mixed in late N.Y. while Dow edges up.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand ADRs were again</p>
<p>mixed in late New York trade. By 7.30 a.m. NZT the Dow was up 40</p>
<p>points at 7,329.32.</p>
<p>Price movements of NZ stocks listed in the U.S. and</p>
<p>Australia.</p>
<p>Company	  Exchange    Last	  Net change</p>
<p>Tranz Rail     N.Y.    US$17 3/8	 +nil   *</p>
<p>FCL Bldg	 N.Y.    US$27 5/8	 +0 3/8 *</p>
<p>FCL Engy	 N.Y.    US$30 7/8	 -0 1/2 *</p>
<p>FCL Paper	N.Y.    US$23		 nil  *</p>
<p>FCL Forest     N.Y.    US$13 1/4	 +0 3/8 *</p>
<p>Telecom	  N.Y.    US$37 3/4	 -0 1/8 *</p>
<p>Lion	    Sydney  untraded</p>
<p>Goodman	 Sydney  A$1.74		nil</p>
<p>Macraes	 Sydney  A$1.98		-8</p>
<p>Notes - In New York, Telecom's American Depository Receipts are traded in bundles of eight shares, while both the Fletcher Challenge shares are in bundles of 10 each. Tranz Rail ADSs are groups of three ordinary shares.</p>
<p>- London prices are mid-rates.</p>
<p>- Asterisk * means stock is still trading</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
